            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "=You are an orchestrator agent for a business's virtual front desk. Your job is to read a customer's message and determine what they need, so the request can be routed to the correct specialist."
            },
            {
              "content": "=Customer name: {{ $json.customer_name }}\nCustomer message: {{ $json.message }}\n\nAnalyze this message and determine:\n1. Does the customer want to book/schedule an appointment? (true/false)\n2. Does the customer have a question that requires looking up company policy or FAQ information? (true/false)\n3. Is this message unclear, sensitive, or something an AI should not handle alone (e.g., a complaint, a legal question, extreme frustration)? (true/false)\n\nAlso extract:\n- If scheduling is needed: what date/time preference did they mention, if any? (or null)\n- If a knowledge question exists: what exactly are they asking about, phrased as a clear standalone question?\n\nRespond with ONLY a valid JSON object in this exact structure, no extra text, no markdown, no code fences:\n{\"needs_scheduling\": true, \"needs_knowledge_answer\": true, \"needs_escalation\": false, \"scheduling_preference\": \"next Tuesday afternoon\", \"knowledge_question\": \"What is your refund policy?\"}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
